# EtTopbar - Agent Guide

> **AI Assistant Documentation**: This guide helps AI coding assistants understand and work with the EtTopbar component.

## Overview

The `EtTopbar` component is a flexible, compound component for building navigation headers in the eToro React Native application. It uses a slot-based architecture with start, middle, and end sections (RTL-aware naming).

## Key Architecture

- **Compound Component Pattern**: `EtTopbar.Start`, `EtTopbar.Middle`, `EtTopbar.End`, `EtTopbar.Action`, `EtTopbar.Title`
- **Explicit Variants**: `EtTopbar` (regular View) and `EtTopbar.Animated` (Animated.View)
- **Slot-Based Layout**: Children are distributed into slots via the `useSlots` hook
- **Automatic Centering**: Middle content is absolutely positioned for true centering
- **RTL-Aware Naming**: Slots use `start`/`middle`/`end` instead of left/right for proper bidirectional support
- **Z-Index Management**: Start/end slots have higher z-index (2) than middle (1) for proper touch handling
- **Theme Integration**: Uses `useEtoroTheme` for background color

